put rpk 1 0
put rpk 2 uchar and m 255
put rpk 3 uchar shr m 8
for i ulong m bound 1100
put rpk add 4 i get pt2 i
end
o = add 4 m
put rpk o uchar and n 255
put rpk add o 1 uchar shr n 8
for i ulong n bound 1100
put rpk add add o 2 i get pth i
end
ret eq renames rpk 0 add add o 2 n 0 0
end
fn putoff v ulong to bool
